  "custom_logic_notes": "This EA uses the MQL5 Standard Library Expert Advisor framework (CExpert, CExpertSignal, CMoneyFixedLot). The actual trading logic is entirely encapsulated in CSignalUniversal which implements 8 configurable signal patterns (A-H) with individual weights. The combined signal is compared against threshold values to decide entries/exits. The TrailingUniversal class handles trailing stop logic. Both are black-box external modules whose internal logic is not visible in this file. Expert_EveryTick=false means the EA processes signals only once per bar, not on every tick. The CExpert base class handles position management, reversal logic, and indicator validation internally.",
